                <mxCell id="p4_cmp" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;Comparison vs MXDOTP (arXiv 2505.13159)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Anchor scope:&lt;/b&gt; ours = one block (32 elements); MXDOTP = one 8-element chunk&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Inner fixed-point width:&lt;/b&gt; ours = R+m+log₂(C·V) → 70b (E5M2²); MXDOTP = 95b&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Outer:&lt;/b&gt; ours = reduced-prec FP (sized by AccPrecision); MXDOTP = FP32&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Format coverage:&lt;/b&gt; ours = all MX × all scale (UE8M0 path); MXDOTP = MXFP8 + UE8M0 only&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
